    "custom_liquid_cqKTNy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"breath-reviews-section\">\n \n\n  <h2 class=\"jlr-heading\">\n    Customer <span class=\"jlr-highlight\">Reviews</span>\n  </h2>\n\n  <div class=\"jlr-grid\">\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n     \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Lina, 34 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I used to keep mints in every bag and still felt nervous talking up close. After a few weeks I stopped reaching for them. Meetings feel a lot less stressful now.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Karim, 41 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"Mouthwash only lasted until my morning coffee. With this, my breath stays fresher through the afternoon. Easy to add to my routine too.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n   \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Sara, 29 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I bought it for my breath but noticed I felt fresher overall after the gym. I'm on my second jar and I'm keeping it.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n   \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Omar, 46 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I was skeptical because nothing had worked long-term before. It took about two weeks to notice, but now I don't think about my breath when I talk to people.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n    \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Maya, 38 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"Morning breath was my biggest insecurity. Waking up and not feeling the need to rush to the bathroom before saying good morning is honestly a small win every day.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n  \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Hadi, 33 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★☆</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"Taste took a few days to get used to, but it's mild. Breath feels cleaner after long workdays, especially after coffee. Would like a bigger jar option.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Rita, 51 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"My grandkids hug me without me worrying anymore. Simple to take, and I like that it's sugar-free and vegan.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n     \n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Jad, 27 <em class=\"jlr-tag\"></em></span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"Got it before a first date and kept using it. I feel way more confident leaning in to talk now, no gum needed.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .breath-reviews-section {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-disclaimer-box {\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto 24px;\n    padding: 16px 20px;\n    background: #fff4d6;\n    border: 2px solid #e0a800;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    color: #4a3b00;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-disclaimer-box strong {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1f2a22;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-highlight {\n    background: #6f8a3c;\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-card {\n    background: #f3f6ea;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n    color: #8a5a00;\n    background: #fff4d6;\n    border: 1px solid #e0a800;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-name {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1f2a22;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-tag {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #8a5a00;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-stars {\n    color: #6f8a3c;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #1f2a22;\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n\n  .breath-reviews-section .jlr-footnote {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 20px auto 0;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #6b7266;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-disclaimer-box {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      padding: 12px 14px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-disclaimer-box strong {\n      font-size: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-heading {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-card {\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-text {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n\n    .breath-reviews-section .jlr-footnote {\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      margin-top: 16px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
